WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:05.088
- There are days in every child's life
that change who they are forever.

00:00:05.631 --> 00:00:07.674
- "Becoming You" is about
the developmental steps

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:10.677
kids go through
between birth and 2,000 days,

00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:12.638
going from this helpless newborn,

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.765
to the most sophisticated animal
on the planet.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:17.476
And we wanted to
capture that journey.

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:20.562
- We had to go and get
the best teams from around the world

00:00:20.646 --> 00:00:22.606
to bring this level
of beauty on the screen.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:25.901
- It's an extraordinarily
difficult show to make.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:31.406
We filmed over 100 children
in 11 countries, 250 days globally.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.408
- We're shooting this in large format,

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:34.910
which is new in
the documentary sphere.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:38.747
Visually, it's pretty breathtaking,
but technically, quite a challenge

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:42.084
when shooting multi-locations,
underwater elements,

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:44.294
going across
all four corners of the globe.

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:46.922
But also working with children.
It's immensely complicated.

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:49.883
- Yah!
- Ready? Roll camera?

00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:51.552
- There was a lot of times
kids don't want to do

00:00:51.635 --> 00:00:52.886
the behavior you're trying to capture.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.388
- No.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:55.848
- Like, naps are my enemy.

00:00:56.849 --> 00:00:58.141
- Aah!
- Aah!

00:00:58.225 --> 00:00:59.226
- Take nine!

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:00.894
- And that's the real challenge.

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:03.230
You can plan for it
and hope it's going to go like this,

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:05.315
but on the day, it's life.
We're not making this up.

00:01:05.399 --> 00:01:06.608
We're just here to film it.

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:08.777
♪ Can we keep our dreams alive ♪

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:12.406
- This is one of the biggest things
you can possibly do

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:13.532
in documentary filmmaking.

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:18.078
The team really did
an incredible job.

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:19.663
- And you're like, "Oh, my God,
this is totally worth it."

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:24.084
- It really shows that we're all going on
the same amazing journey,

00:01:24.168 --> 00:01:25.752
and I think it's really remarkable.

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:28.088
♪ Can we keep our dreams alive ♪

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:32.593
- This is the extraordinary story
all about us.

00:01:32.676 --> 00:01:33.635
- Hi.

